T-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">육성지원 프로그램 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">한국 대학생 지식봉사 멘토링</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">에 열의가 있는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">대학생 멘토 여러분의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012년 11월 22일</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">한국장학재단 이사장</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 474.34pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 2.82pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 사업 소개</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대학생 멘토가 방학 기간동안 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">초,중,고교</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 멘티에게 학습지도 및 진로, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">고민</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">상담 등의 멘토링을 해주고, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">재단은 참여 대학생이 미래 성공인재로 양성될 수 있도록 지원하는 인재육성지원 사업</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 31.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">항 목</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 31.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PA