: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">초·중·고등학교 등 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">정부인증 사회봉사기관</span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">에서 초,중,고등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학교 학생을 대상으로 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">지식봉사(교육기부) 활동 예정인</span></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 대학 재학생 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">재단에서 신규매칭이 불가능하므로, 멘티기관과 매칭이 완료된 학생만 신청 가능</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\">※ 별도 성적기준 없음 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 정부인증 사회봉사기관 여부는 보건복지부(www.vms.or.kr), 행정안전부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; text-shadow: auto\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.1365.go.kr) 등 참조, 정부인증기관이 아닌 경우 모든 혜택이 지원되지 않음</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 474.34pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 2.82pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 신청 기간 및 방법</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;신청기간 : 2012년 11월 26일(월)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">~ 12월 10일(월) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;신청</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-